<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Bearish-Flag"></span><strong>Bearish Flag</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3>



<p>A bearish flag is the complete opposite of a bullish flag crypto chart pattern. It is formed by a sharp downtrend and consolidation with higher highs that ends when the price breaks and drops down. These flags are bearish continuation patterns, so they give a sell signal. You can learn more about them in<a href="https://changelly.com/blog/bear-flag-pattern/" data-wpel-link="internal" target="_self" rel="follow"> this article</a>.</p>



