<p>A bullish pennant is a bullish pole chart pattern rather similar to a bullish flag. It also has a pole â€” a shart uptrend â€” followed by a brief (or not so brief) consolidation, and then a continued uptrend. Unlike the flag, however, its consolidation period is shaped like a triangle: it has higher lows and lower highs. It gives a buy signal.</p>



