<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How-to-catch-a-crypto-pump"></span><strong><strong>How to catch a crypto pump?</strong></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3>



<p>Predicting a crypto pump is no easy task, but there are a few things you can look out for that may give you some clues. These include:</p>



<ul>
<li>Increased social media activity</li>



<li>Frequent occurrences of FOMO in the community</li>



